%N A081303 a(n) = gpf(n) - 2*lpf(n), where gpf(n) is the greatest and lpf(n) is the least prime factor of n (A006530, A020639).
%H A081303 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A081303/b081303.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%t A081303 A081303[n_] := #[[-1, 1]] - 2*#[[1, 1]] & [FactorInteger[n]];
